    {
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Ways You Can Connect With FBCM to serve our community"
    },
    {
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Get Involved"
    }
  ],
  "bodyText": "Outreach\n\nFBCM desires to join Christ where he is already at work in our world — in Muncie and across the globe. We do so personally, by sharing the mercy and love that God has shown us with others. We also do this with community partners, stewarding our resources to support them in their work.\n\nWays You Can Connect With FBCM to serve our community\n\nVolunteering with our partner organizations or at community events.\n\nSpecial offerings and projects for disaster relief, mission work, and other needs.\n\nSewing Group (Rm 203) - A multi-aged, monthly group which sews pillowcases for those in need.\n\nUse our building for something great! FBCM offers our facilities to host outside events and organizations. Our website has links to our building use policy here.\n\nGet Involved\n\nIf you wish to be a part of our outreach ministry, contact us!\n\nDana Davis\n\nCCT Outreach Representative\n\noutreach[at]fbcmuncie.org",
